<title>JAPAN: Japan personal loan firms weak in Tokyo afternoon.</title>
<headline>Japan personal loan firms weak in Tokyo afternoon.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese personal loan firms were feeble in the Friday afternoon session, discouraged by the recent cut in Credit Saison Co Ltd's rating, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0430 GMT, Promise Co Ltd had fallen 350 yen to 5,200 yen to become the fourth largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo bourse. Acom Co Ltd fell 250 yen to 4,700 yen.</p>
</text>
